  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Participation of Women in Peace and Human Security,Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One part of the project aims at strengthening women&#x2019;s social networking capacities towards effective participation in formal peace processes, and will be implemented in three states in the Niger Delta Region, Delta, Edo and Rivers States
The second part of the project aims at promoting women&#x2019;s participation in countering violent extremism to advance the implementation of the Nigerian National Action Plan (NAP) on UNSCR 1325, and will be implemented in the North East of Nigeria in, Katagum, Bauc</narrative>
  </description>
